{"id":"4129a86b73f8c630","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md","title":"ZFC Top Nowhere Dense Subset","display":"df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset — ZFC Top Nowhere Dense Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset — ZFC Top Nowhere Dense Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator]]","[[58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset — ZFC Top Nowhere Dense Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" href=\"?note=d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator\">58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00b8e7b7531f5138\" href=\"?note=00b8e7b7531f5138\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator\">58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (closure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" href=\"?note=d5b6b8b83b0796ef\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator\">58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (interior relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00b8e7b7531f5138\" href=\"?note=00b8e7b7531f5138\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator\">58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C,I\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)\\land I=\\varnothing\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C,I\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)\\land I=\\varnothing\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure and interior are relations in the upstream atoms, not unary operators indexed by a hidden topology; their output witnesses are now explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d5b6b8b83b0796ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator","status":"resolved","id":"00b8e7b7531f5138","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d5b6b8b83b0796ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)$ (closure relation, see [[58-df-zfc-top-closure-operator]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator","status":"resolved","id":"00b8e7b7531f5138","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)$ (interior relation, see [[58-df-zfc-top-interior-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists C,I\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopClosureOperator}_S(C,A,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopInteriorOperator}_S(I,C,X,\\tau)\\land I=\\varnothing\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"fd5c17d95dadab7c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S$ is the nowhere-dense predicate (see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md]])"},{"id":"93870bfe2a48922a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S$ is the nowhere-dense predicate (see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md]])"},{"id":"3797dce1ae5fa1c3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopNowhereDenseSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (canonical predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-dense-subset.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3525","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top-nowhere-d